<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LIISING TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</title>
<headline>HANSA LIISING TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa Liising, the leasing subsidiary of Hansapank , will issue 40 million kroons of commercial papers on June 17, Hansapank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The three-month commercial papers have a yield of 7.25 percent, Ulo Kallas, interest rate products manager with the bank, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6 209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
